{
  "en": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT": "Moving around builds up <style=cIsUtility>charge</style>, granting up to <style=cIsUtility>+160% movement speed</style> and <style=cIsUtility>+200% jump height</style> at 100%. At 25% charge or higher, jumping triggers an <style=cIsDamage>explosive discharge</style> for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% <style=cStack>(+{1}% per stack)</style> damage</style> in a 17m-32m <style=cStack>(+7.5m per stack)</style> area.",
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_UNCOMMON_DESC_FMT": "Moving around builds up <style=cIsUtility>charge</style>, granting up to <style=cIsUtility>+160% movement speed</style> and <style=cIsUtility>+200% jump height</style> at 100%. At 25% charge or higher, jumping consumes <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>75%</style> charge and triggers an <style=cIsDamage>explosive discharge</style> for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% <style=cStack>(+{1}% per stack)</style> damage</style>, plus an additional <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>150% <style=cStack>(+150% per stack)</style> damage</style> for every <style=cIsUtility>100% movement speed</style>, in a 5m to 32.3m <style=cStack>(+7.5m per stack)</style> area.",
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_RARE_DESC_FMT": "Moving around builds up <style=cIsUtility>charge</style>, granting up to <style=cIsUtility>+160% movement speed</style> and <style=cIsUtility>+200% jump height</style> at 100%. At 25% charge or higher, jumping consumes <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>50%</style> charge and triggers an <style=cIsDamage>explosive discharge</style> for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% <style=cStack>(+{1}% per stack)</style> damage</style>, plus an additional <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>250% <style=cStack>(+250% per stack)</style> damage</style> for every <style=cIsUtility>100% movement speed</style>, in a 5m to 32.3m <style=cStack>(+7.5m per stack)</style> area.",
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_EPIC_DESC_FMT": "Moving around builds up <style=cIsUtility>charge</style>, granting up to <style=cIsUtility>+160% movement speed</style> and <style=cIsUtility>+200% jump height</style> at 100%. At 25% charge or higher, jumping consumes <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>25%</style> charge and triggers an <style=cIsDamage>explosive discharge</style> for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% <style=cStack>(+{1}% per stack)</style> damage</style>, plus an additional <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>350% <style=cStack>(+350% per stack)</style> damage</style> for every <style=cIsUtility>100% movement speed</style>, in a 5m to 32.3m <style=cStack>(+7.5m per stack)</style> area.",
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_LEGENDARY_DESC_FMT": "Moving around builds up <style=cIsUtility>charge</style>, granting up to <style=cIsUtility>+160% movement speed</style> and <style=cIsUtility>+200% jump height</style> at 100%. At 25% charge or higher, jumping consumes <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>10%</style> charge and triggers an <style=cIsDamage>explosive discharge</style> for <style=cIsDamage>{0}% <style=cStack>(+{1}% per stack)</style> damage</style>, plus an additional <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>500% <style=cStack>(+500% per stack)</style> damage</style> for every <style=cIsUtility>100% movement speed</style>, in a 5m to 32.3m <style=cStack>(+7.5m per stack)</style> area.",
  },
  "de": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "Durch Bewegung baut sich <style=cIsUtility>Ladung</style> auf, die bis zu <style=cIsUtility>+160 % Bewegungsgeschwindigkeit</style> und <style=cIsUtility>+200 % Sprunghöhe</style> bei 100 % gewährt. Bei 25 % Ladung oder höher löst das Springen eine <style=cIsDamage>explosive Entladung</style> für <style=cIsDamage>{0} % <style=cStack>(+{1} % pro Stapel) </style>Schaden</style> in einem Bereich von 17-32 m <style=cStack>(+7,5 m pro Stapel)</style> aus.",
  },
  "es-419": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "Al moverte, acumulas <style=cIsUtility>carga</style>, lo que te otorga hasta un <style=cIsUtility>+160 % de velocidad de movimiento</style> y un <style=cIsUtility>+200 % de altura de salto</style> al 100 %. Con un 25 % de carga o más, el salto libera una descarga explosiva <style=cIsDamage></style>que causa un <style=cIsDamage>{0} % de daño <style=cStack>(+{1} % por acumulación)</style></style> en un área de 17 a 32 m <style=cStack>(+7,5 m por acumulación)</style>.",
  },
  "es-ES": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "Al moverte, acumulas <style=cIsUtility>carga</style>, lo que te otorga hasta un <style=cIsUtility>+160 % de velocidad de movimiento</style> y un <style=cIsUtility>+200 % de altura de salto</style> al 100 %. Con un 25 % de carga o más, el salto libera una descarga explosiva <style=cIsDamage></style>que causa un <style=cIsDamage>{0} % de daño <style=cStack>(+{1} % por acumulación)</style></style> en un área de 17 a 32 m <style=cStack>(+7,5 m por acumulación)</style>.",
  },
  "fr": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "Se déplacer accumule de la <style=cIsUtility>charge</style> qui octroie jusqu'à <style=cIsUtility>+160 % de vitesse de déplacement</style> et <style=cIsUtility>+200 % de hauteur de saut</style> à 100 %. Si vous avez au moins 25 % de charge, sauter déclenche une <style=cIsDamage>décharge explosive</style> qui inflige <style=cIsDamage>{0} % de dégâts <style=cStack>(+{1} % de dégâts par cumul)</style></style> dans une zone de 17 à 32 m <style=cStack>(+7,5 m par cumul)</style>.",
  },
  "it": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "Muoverti fa accumulare <style=cIsUtility>carica</style>, e conferisce fino a <style=cIsUtility>+160% di velocità di movimento</style> e <style=cIsUtility>+200% di altezza del salto</style> al 100%. Al 25% o più di carica, saltare innesca una <style=cIsDamage>scarica esplosiva</style> che infligge il <style=cIsDamage>{0}% <style=cStack>(+{1}% per accumulo)</style> di danni</style> in un raggio da 17 a 32 metri <style=cStack>(+7,5 metri per accumulo)</style>.",
  },
  "ja": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "動き回ると<style=cIsUtility>チャージ</style>が溜まり、100% で<style=cIsUtility>移動速度が +160%</style>、<style=cIsUtility>ジャンプの高さが +200%</style>まで増える。25% 以上のチャージでジャンプすると、<style=cIsDamage>爆発放電</style>が発生し、<style=cIsDamage>{0}%<style=cStack>(スタックごとに +{1}%)</style>のダメージ</style>を17m～32m<style=cStack>(スタックごとに +7.5m)</style>のエリアに与える。",
  },
  "ko": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "이동 시 <style=cIsUtility>충전량</style>이 축적되어 100%에 도달하면 <style=cIsUtility>이동 속도가 +160%</style>, <style=cIsUtility>점프 높이가 +200%</style> 증가합니다. 충전량이 25% 이상일 때 점프하면 <style=cIsDamage>폭발적인 방출</style>이 발동해 17m에서 32m<style=cStack>(중첩당 +7.5m)</style> 범위에 <style=cIsDamage>{0}%<style=cStack>(중첩당 +{1}%)</style>의 피해</style>를 입힙니다.",
  },
  "pt-BR": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "Movimento constante gera <style=cIsUtility>carga</style>, concedendo até <style=cIsUtility>+160% de velocidade de movimento</style> e <style=cIsUtility>+200% de altura do salto</style> ao atingir 100%. Com 25% de carga ou mais, o salto libera uma <style=cIsDamage>descarga explosiva</style> de <style=cIsDamage>{0}% <style=cStack>(+{1}% por acúmulo)</style> de dano</style> em uma área de 17 m a 32 m <style=cStack>(+7,5 m por acúmulo)</style>.",
  },
  "ru": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "При беге накапливает <style=cIsUtility>заряд</style>, который при максимальной мощности даёт <style=cIsUtility>+160% к скорости движения</style> и <style=cIsUtility>+200% к высоте прыжка</style>. При мощности заряда выше 25% прыжки создают <style=cIsDamage>электрические разряды</style>, наносящие <style=cIsDamage>{0}% урона <style=cStack>(+{1}% за шт.)</style></style> в области размером 17 на 32 метров <style=cStack>(+7,5 м за шт.)</style>.",
  },
  "tr": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "Etrafta dolaşmak <style=cIsUtility>şarj</style> oluşturur ve %100'de en fazla <style=cIsUtility>+%160 hareket hızı</style> ve <style=cIsUtility>+%200 zıplama yüksekliği</style> sağlar. %25 veya daha yüksek şarjda zıplama, bir <style=cIsDamage>patlayıcı yük boşaltma</style> tetikleyerek 17 m ila 32 m'lik <style=cStack>(birikim başına +%7,5)</style> bir alanda <style=cIsDamage>%{0} <style=cStack>(birikim başına +%{1})</style> hasara</style> yol açar.",
  },
  "zh-CN": {
    "ITEM_JUMPDAMAGESTRIKE_DESC_FMT" : "四处走动会累积<style=cIsUtility>充能</style>，充能达到100%时，提供最多<style=cIsUtility>+160%移动速度</style>和<style=cIsUtility>+200%跳跃高度</style>加成。充能在25%或以上时，跳跃会触发<style=cIsDamage>爆炸性放电</style>，对17米到32米的范围内<style=cStack>（每层+7.5米）</style>区域造成<style=cIsDamage>{0}%<style=cStack>（每层+{1}%）</style>伤害</style>。",
  }
}
